# Build context for mcp_server/Dockerfile, whose context is the repo root
# because it copies pyproject.toml, uv.lock and six top-level packages.
# Docker tars the whole context to the daemon before it reads a single COPY,
# so everything here is excluded for size alone: on the benchmark box the
# checkout carries a full clone, the applications submodule and a populated
# .venv by the time build_mcp_image.sh runs, none of which the image needs.
.git
.venv
SREGym-applications
sregym-results
sregym-run-logs
logs
**/__pycache__
**/.pytest_cache
